      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've noticed something weird lately and i cant figure out if im losing it or if there's actual data here. my heart rate and sleep patterns have been spiking exactly when the market volatility hits high peaks. like, a few days ago on the 17th, i woke up with this intense pounding in my chest right as the tech stocks took that massive dip. it felt way too precise to be a coincidence. can u help me look at how to track this better so i can see if there's a pattern i can actually use?",
