      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To find a precise lag time, you should compare your tracked heart rate to leading indicators that measure market anticipation rather than just the reaction. Indicators like the VIX (Volatility Index) are excellent choices as they measure expected future volatility, which often precedes sudden movements. Additionally, comparing your data against historical volume spikes can reveal preemptive patterns. Mapping your biometric spikes against the VIX changes should help isolate if your body anticipates the market shifts.",
